owershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download cargo-cyclonedx 0.5.10\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [cargo-cyclonedx-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [cargo-cyclonedx-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.10/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n## Verifying GitHub Artifact Attestations\n\nThe artifacts in this release have attestations generated with GitHub Artifact Attestations. These can be verified by using the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/manual/gh_attestation_verify):\n```sh\ngh attestation verify <file-path of downloaded artifact> --repo CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo\n```\n\nYou can also download the attestation from [GitHub](https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/attestations) and verify against that directly:\n```sh\ngh attestation verify <file-path of downloaded artifact> --bundle <file-path of downloaded attestation> --repo CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo\n```\n\n\n"}